<title>FINLAND: ATHLETICS-LEADING RESULTS AT PAAVO NURMI MEETING.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-LEADING RESULTS AT PAAVO NURMI MEETING.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
