<p>Nurmi international athletics meeting in Turku on Thursday:</p>
<p>Men's 1,500 metres</p>
<p> 1. Paul Bitok (Kenya)     3 minutes 36.87 seconds</p>
<p> 2. David Kisand (Kenya)	     3:37.69</p>
<p> 3. John Kosgei (Kenya)		3:38.73</p>
